.TH HOODMIN-BACKUP 8 "2026-10-18" "Hoodmin 0.1.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
hoodmin-backup \- back up Hoodmin data and encryption key
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hoodmin-backup
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run as root. Writes a PostgreSQL custom-format dump, encryption key, environment settings, AutoSign account/certificate files and package version under /var/backups/hoodmin with private permissions. Transfer the backup to independent encrypted storage. Never restore over a live database without separately verifying recovery.
.SH SEE ALSO
